  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=793410), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8364381)  \n‘Moon Yu-byeol’ has lived as a brilliant influencer.  \n His father's business goes bankrupt and he comes down to his maternal grandfather's house in Seongwol as if he were being chased.  \n He meets 'Orion', a man living there.  \n \n To get out of debt,  \n Yubyeol struggles to receive the inheritance left by his maternal grandfather,  \n Leon, who interferes with farewell at every turn.  \n \n Will Yubyeol be able to safely receive her inheritance and return to her original life?  \n A healing romance unfolding in Seongwol!",
